# ✅ Answers (उत्तर और संक्षिप्त कारण)

1. **Kitten** — Lion-Cub relation = Cat-Kitten.
2. **Paint** (या Clean) — Brush का कार्य = Paint / Clean (context पर निर्भर)। सामान्य: **Paint**.
3. **Galaxy** (या Constellation) — Tree\:Forest as Star\:Galaxy (exam में आसान: **Constellation / Galaxy**).
4. **Sad** — Smile\:Happy :: Cry\:Sad.
5. **Hear** — Eye\:See :: Ear\:Hear.
6. **Boat** — Wheel\:Car :: Sail\:Boat.
7. **Metal/Tool** — Baker\:Bread :: Blacksmith\:Metal (या Tools) — सामान्य: **Metal**.
8. **Write** — Book\:Read :: Pen\:Write.
9. **Sweat** — Cold→Shiver, Hot→Sweat.
10. **Day** — Moon\:Night :: Sun\:Day.
11. **Scale / Fin** — Bird\:Feather :: Fish\:Scale (या Fin). बेहतर: **Scale**.
12. **Seat/Papal Chair** — King\:Throne :: Pope\:Chair (या Papal Throne).
13. **Salty** — Sugar\:Sweet :: Salt\:Salty.
14. **Meow** — Dog\:Bark :: Cat\:Meow.
15. **Heal** (या Treat) — Teacher\:Teach :: Doctor\:Heal/Treat.
16. **Fan / AC** — Rain→Umbrella protects from rain; Heat→Fan/AC protect from heat. सामान्य: **Fan**.
17. **Fish** — Sparrow is a Bird; Salmon is a Fish.
18. **Daughter** — Father\:Son :: Mother\:Daughter (gender pair).
19. **Hundred**? Wait: Hundred : Ten (ratio 10) → Thousand : Hundred (ratio 10) → **Hundred**.
20. **ZAB**? Check: ABC→CDE (+2 to each). A→C (+2), B→D, C→E. So XYZ → ZAB (X→Z, Y→A(?), Z→B) — yes wrap-around. **ZAB**.

